></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>机械工程学院与学校同历史，是学校办学规模最大、学科专业最强、社会影响最广的学院之一。学院始终以为党育英才，为国铸利器为使命，牢记“唯实 献身”院训，在2024年，学院同时获得全国教育系统先进集体和全国党建工作标杆院系培育创建单位两项殊荣。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VwHrl7yYVnzO8FtCyBHqlH573XJx0UUDgYIz9ewkFrJaCNyaibATxlbQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89V2fUrmyGKicbn95wEXp4Hnpxup0yaewnlhIeK8ibvPUwblALbIwkPPB0A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>机构设置</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院发展至今，拥有13个系所（火炮工程系、弹药工程系、自动武器工程系、火箭导弹发射工程系、机械设计及自动化系、制造工程及自动化系、机械电子工程系、车辆工程系、工业工程系、仪器科学与技术系、航空宇航系、工程安全防护所和智能无人系统创新中心）、2个实验教学示范中心（机械工程实验教学中心、武器系统与工程实验教学中心）。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89Vos3iaibG1vjt9mpibX0qFnLeDyPsnK9844hHhcLIyFN5CyuTPhzPmEiaLg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院规模</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院现有教职工363人，其中专任教师272人，教授、副教授237人，占专任教师的比例87.1%。专任教师中，拥有博士学位者251人，约占92.3%；拥有正高级职称者83人、副高级职称154人，约占87.1%；35岁以下青年教师48人，约占17.6%；具有海外经历者120人，约占44.1%。</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>学院现有国家级高层次人才60人次，省部级高层次人才157人次，高层次团队16个。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VBF5MfxtNR2ibTqMqgtg3tEMrtfSkkMibkHKKiaexqe7ficVxd2wT8TSFcw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>学院现有学生5287人，硕士生1922人，博士生741人，留学生67人。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VpNbs0jl7ic266buEJrhye4bMVyPLeEoPcKYSO6FGg6U0XPD3FZJp5og/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学科专业</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院拥有四个一级学科：兵器科学与技术、机械工程、航空宇航科学与技术、仪器科学与技术。其中兵器学科在历次全国评估中位居最前列；机械学科在第五轮评估中进入A类学科。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VmzZrKsCVQlNSZiak6EdwfThc6FkEiaBN9ta8BZTK1Swp3nWe3lOF19Rg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院设有8个专业，包括武器系统与工程、机械工程、弹药工程与爆炸技术、飞行器设计与工程、工业工程、测控技术与仪器6个国家一流专业；车辆工程是江苏省一流专业；以及机器人工程，机器人工程是2019年开始招生的新工科专业。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VLJee2LZNmA41eicCUouiblFxdUoa0wx8L6D80PU1XKdE40pKuMXpbvlQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>科学研究</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>围绕国家发展重大需求，紧跟国际发展前沿，坚持“陆、海、空、天、信”立体多域发展，面向“两化融合”，主动作为，发挥学科特色优势作用，学院依据自身优势，推动人工智能技术、测控技术、机器人技术与武器装备研制、卫星研制、高端装备深度融合，为学生创新能力培养、国际化视野拓展筑平台、拓通道、建舞台。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89Vnsy6x2znn8jxqEKYGibicoNHD3ZE2s8VP397nhLfw8qtO95w4Rtibecgw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>学院近三年的年科研经费接近6个亿。在“十四五”期间，学院新增6个国家级平台，新增4项国家科技奖励，其中牵头的有3项，为学生培养提供了坚实有力的科研创新实践支撑。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VIESY1FklWPGUgeRT2UAAl9QEiciadRKqaic9ruBibWF6VruMOxA4mLiaHGQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span> </span></p><p><span>学院先后两次被中央组织部、工业和信息化部、人力资源和社会保障部、国防科技工业局、中央军委装备发展部等多部委联合授予《高技术武器装备发展建设工程突出贡献奖》，共获国家科学技术奖25项、各类省部级科技奖励388项。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89Ve18Gy75y5PK0NMmYXM36xmC3OdN0UsXb9XsGu9Hr8s3ckRvem0mwtQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人才培养</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院采用统一的“基础课程实验-创新实践大赛-科研训练-毕业设计”的进阶式创新教育模式。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VsjTIZ9ZEUVrzhMmQVLkQibX75IaMASjNDFqVcew6sK7F2PSicPXtffwg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VL2hG1Ipq8sCGgnG0hc0I7JMXyjNYVn3oDN8FTib2WLScUt1RCb9hCgQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><span>学院现有6个创客空间（机器人工作室、机械创新工作室、方程式赛车、工业工程工作室、无人作战系统创新工作室、立方体卫星工作室），覆盖25项国家级、省部级赛事。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89Vv9zxQ8GnlbXe697biaIibgY9O6SByGofQSVKqC7Hq0lAq3sV9qqM7icmw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VXYUic22AkMYAdDZ8vzZ7nzw4oGgic7xUtJvFBo8hicd0pG8YeicnGBANgA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>文化建设</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院十分注重思想文化建设，举办军工文化节等活动，涌现出了一批荣获中国大学生自强之星等荣誉的优秀学子。</span><span><span> </span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VvFFGuY2MBhGJZwMXMj1Hwnhvp1abRLb4ic6oibQRBllqlkTicPopB7eBg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>学生发展</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VRzU3tgbDJnzoqtpAkfiaqdG1e4RvTxS00VaABOQg3pP0IAgG7S9XnRw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>就业情况</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>近三年本科生平均保研率近30%，升学出国率近60%，本科生年终就业率达99%。</span><span>学院是全国唯一获得就业先进工作单位殊荣的二级学院。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VIsHGUEm0RN2ESYSo8EU8bzUEY3cGUUGluyNibIicmV5zzamKwpFbY9yw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>我们有：一流的师资队伍，一流的科研平台，一流的学科专业，一流的学生培养，一流的杰出院友。欢迎报考机械工程学院！</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VsjLLtzI5O1laPibss4dGLDAqicOAX6PM2vjJ5xuTmj4EOeaiaTtFuZHLQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>注：2026年学院招收的硕士研究生均在南京校区培养。</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开放日</span></strong><strong><span>基本信息</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VRzU3tgbDJnzoqtpAkfiaqdG1e4RvTxS00VaABOQg3pP0IAgG7S9XnRw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动人数</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>500人左右（视报名情况动态选择）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>线上（直播平台+腾讯会议）</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>2025年7月11日20:00报名开始， 7月15日15:00报名截止</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>该部分内容应包括对报名人员的专业、成绩、品德、心理等方面的要求，可参考如下内容：</span></p><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2026年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好（四六级成绩或其他资格考试证明）；</span></p><p><span>（2）招生学科和专业及相近专业（见表一），且申请人应有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>表一</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VteYdeDWFMNndicxDXOQkddiboZxFtht7Hl49VcCiadDicS0g2K8l2Ey5Ig/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力；</span></span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，学院根据学科特点、开放日规模，选择一定数量学生参加开放日活动，并通过学院网站公示方式进行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请人须在7月15日下午15:00前将以下申请材料扫描为一个pdf，发送至各负责人邮箱</span><strong><span><span>（见表三）</span></span></strong><span>，邮件主题命名格式为：</span><strong><span><span>“姓名-本科院校-报考专业-联系方式”</span></span></strong><span>，</span><strong><span><span>每人限报一个专业，不得重复申请（多方向的专业限选该专业一个方向）</span></span></strong><span>，逾期不再接受申请。</span></p><p><span>以下为申请材料清单：</span></p><p><span>1、《南京理工大学校园开放日活动申请表》；</span></p><p><span>2、身份证、学生证复印件；</span></p><p><span>3、本科阶段成绩单（盖教务处章）；</span></p><p><span>4、国家英语四级、六级考试成绩单复印件及其他证明材料等；</span></p><p><span>5、各类获奖证书、公开发表的学术论文或其他学术成果等。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>表二</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJSDFM6CH0pWa8vl2aXxa89VxUIMbtzVNTUulZVaByMLS9GficLwdAuCxSubrZp5PbJQSW8ABwbaEAA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></s